<title>USA: SEACOR completes Galaxie acquisition.</title>
<headline>SEACOR completes Galaxie acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEACOR Holdings Inc on Friday said it completed the acquisition of &quot;substantially all&quot; of the assets of Galaxie Marine Service Inc and affiliated companies for $23.62 million.</p>
<p>The company said it had paid $20.57 million in cash and 50,000 shares of common stock worth $3.05 million for the assets.</p>
<p>The Galaxie fleet includes 24 vessels, an offshore supply vessel, a mini supply vessel, five crew boats and 17 utility boats, it said.</p>
<p>SEACOR said it had also assumed a contract for an offshore supply vessel, which is under construction at Houma Fabricators.</p>
